        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lamar Odom\n- Organizations: Los Angeles Clippers, Los Angeles Lakers, National Basketball Association\n- Events: 1999–2000 Los Angeles Clippers season\n- Awards: All-Rookie First Team, NBA championships, NBA Sixth Man of the Year\n\nFacts:\n- In the 1999–2000 Los Angeles Clippers season, top draft pick Lamar Odom averaged 16.6 points per game for the Los Angeles Clippers.\n- In the 1999–2000 Los Angeles Clippers season, Lamar Odom was named to the All-Rookie First Team.\n- As a member of the Los Angeles Lakers in the National Basketball Association, Lamar Odom won NBA championships in 2009 and 2010.\n- As a member of the Los Angeles Lakers in the National Basketball Association, Lamar Odom was named the NBA Sixth Man of the Year in 2011.",
